			"date": "2024-03-28T14:05:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> developers and software publishers need to realize that everyone don't have high end, multicore, 5nm cpu with 32gb RAM.</p><p>This thing -&gt; <a href=\"https://upstash.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">upstash.com/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> for example consumes 50mb heap on startup, for displaying a \"static\" landing page 😭😭😭 (I believe a vast amount of this insane memory consumption is caused by telemetry, session replay and other sneaky stuffs that companies shouldn't do)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
